      "metadata": {
        "split_group": "reinsertion_notice"
      },
      "narrative": "A collection account was deleted after an earlier reinvestigation. The furnisher later certified that the item was complete and accurate, and the CRA reinserted the item. The CRA had procedures to prevent reappearance without certification. The reinsertion notice identified the furnisher and included the consumer-statement right, but the notice was sent on the seventh business day after reinsertion. In the current dispute, the CRA otherwise received a valid direct dispute, notified the furnisher within 5 business days, reasonably reinvestigated, verified the item as accurate, completed within 30 days, and sent a timely results notice.\n",
      "provenance": "authored",
      "structured_fields": {},
      "title": "Reinserted item certified but notice sent late"
    },
