      "metadata": {
        "split_group": "reseller_own_error"
      },
      "narrative": "The consumer disputed a tenant-screening report through a reseller. The reseller determined that the inaccurate rent-balance item came from its own transcription error rather than from the source CRA. The reseller corrected the item and deleted the erroneous balance within 12 days. No source-CRA reinvestigation was required for the reseller's own error. No consumer statement was filed, no reinsertion occurred, and no direct furnisher dispute was sent.\n",
      "provenance": "authored",
      "structured_fields": {},
      "title": "Reseller corrects its own error within 20 days"
